menu "NowTP"

    config NOWTP_NO_STREAMS
        bool "Leave out streams (port 251)"
        default n
        help
            EspNowTransport never creates Streams, and sendStream() returns
            InvalidState. Saves about 5.5 KB of flash.

    config NOWTP_NO_TIMESYNC
        bool "Leave out network time (port 252)"
        default n
        help
            EspNowTransport never creates TimeSync; network time is the local clock.

    config NOWTP_NO_SECURITY
        bool "Leave out authentication and pairing (port 253)"
        default n
        help
            EspNowTransport never creates Security: no installation key, no pairing.

    config NOWTP_NO_DIAGNOSTICS
        bool "Leave out diagnostics (port 254)"
        default n
        help
            No diagnostics responder, and ping(), measureLink(), diagnose(),
            optimizeLink() and deepDiscover() return InvalidState. Peers can't
            run diagnostics against this node either.

endmenu
